--- !u!114 &73013770
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 73013769}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 51bf743a7b9a61e409329faa416e2f81, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Ronin7.World::Ronin7.World.Story.DialoguePlayer
  lines:
  - speaker: Soren
    text: It's Khall. The thing in the loop is Khall. Of course it is. Of all the
      deaths they could make me die over and over, they picked the man who pulled
      my switch. The handler in the doorway. They know exactly where the wound is.
      Every loop it's him, blade up, between me and the way out, and every loop I
      take the same line at him and every loop it kills me. So stop taking the same
      line.
    seconds: 25
    clip: {fileID: 0}
  textMesh: {fileID: 802266007}
  panelRoot: {fileID: 545013521}
  audioSource: {fileID: 73013771}
